R5 · power vs PAIR COUNT — one-sided exact McNemar on discordant pairs
seed=4242  trials=2000  alpha=0.05  descriptor baseline p=0.55

CONSERVATIVE by construction: concordance=0 (arms err independently).
Shared pair difficulty RAISES power (measured 0.70 -> 0.98 at n=40), so a
real study sits ABOVE these rows. A2 pushes the other way; do not net them.

